* it is preceded by a modifier, such as in {{m|ja||山田さんの所に|tr=Yamada-san no tokoro ni|at Yamada-san's place}}
* it appears as a grammatical element, such as in {{m|ja||ところが|tr=tokoro ga|however}} or {{m|ja||ところで|tr=tokoro de|by the way}}

