====Definitions====
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# to [[hold]]; to [[grasp]]; to [[take]]
#: {{zh-x|把握|to grasp; to control; to master}}
#: {{zh-x|媽媽{ma} 手把手 教 我 寫字。|My mom held my hand and taught me to write.|tr=Māma shǒu'''bǎ'''shǒu jiào wǒ xiězì.}}
#* {{zh-x|縱 有 健婦 把 鋤犁，禾 生 隴畝 無 東西。|Even though there are sturdy wives to '''hold''' the hoe and plow, the grain grows on the field boundary slopes and one can’t tell east from west.|CL|ref=8th century, {{lw|zh|杜甫}} ({{w|Du Fu}}), {{lang|zh|《兵車行》}} (''The Army Wagons: A Ballad''); translated by {{w|Stephen Owen (sinologist)|Stephen Owen}}|tr=Zòng yǒu jiànfù '''bǎ''' chúlí, hé shēng lǒngmǔ wú dōngxī.}}
# to [[control]]; to [[dominate]]
#: {{zh-x|把控|to control|tr='''bǎ'''kòng}}
# to [[guard]]; to have [[control]] over
#: {{zh-x|把守|to guard; to defend|tr='''bǎ'''shǒu}}
#: {{zh-x|把門|to '''guard''' a door or gate}}
#* {{zh-x|令 人 傳 我 的 號令 去，著[着]{zhuó} 下將軍 ^韓 ^厥，把 住 府-門，不 搜 進去 的，只 搜 出來 的。|ref=Zhaoshi Gu'er}}
# {{lb|zh|colloquial}} to be [[close]]; to be [[near]]
# to [[hold]] a baby while it relieves itself
#: {{zh-x|把尿|to hold a baby while it urinates|tr='''bǎ'''niào}}
# {{lb|zh|TCM}} to [[feel]] (for the [[pulse]])
#: {{zh-x|我 替 施主 把 把脈。|Let me feel the pulse for you.|tr=Wǒ tì shīzhǔ '''bǎ''' '''bǎ'''mài.}}
# {{n-g-lite|A light verb or preposition placed before the object of a sentence to allow it to be placed before the verb, giving greater flexibility in complex sentence construction.}}
#: {{zh-x|他 把 刀 放 在 桌子{zi} 上。|He put the knife on the table.|tr=Tā '''bǎ''' dāo fàng zài zhuōzi shàng.}}
# {{n-g-lite|Used before a “subject + verb + complement” structure}}; to [[cause]] to; to [[make]]
#: {{zh-x|真的 把 我 氣死 了！|It really '''made''' me so mad!|tr=Zhēnde '''bǎ''' wǒ qìsǐ le!}}
# [[bundle]]; [[bunch]]
#: {{zh-x|火把|torch (stick with a flame on one end)|tr=huǒ'''bǎ'''}}
# [[handle]]; [[knob]]; [[grip]] {{gloss-lite|a part of an object which is held in the hand}}
#: {{zh-x|車把|handlebar (of a bicycle)|tr=chē'''bǎ'''}}
#: {{zh-x|刀把{bà}|knife '''handle'''; hilt|tr=dāo'''bà'''}}
# [[stem]] (of a [[flower]], [[leaf]], [[fruit]], etc.)
#: {{zh-x|葉把{bà}兒{r}|stem of a leaf|tr=yè'''bà'''r}}
# {{zh-classifier|[[object]]s that can be held using [[handle]]s or [[knob]]s, such as [[gun]]s, [[chair]]s, [[broom]]s, or [[umbrella]]s|cat=y}}
#: {{zh-x|三 把 刀|three knives|tr=sān '''bǎ''' dāo}}
#: {{zh-x|四 把 鉸{gaau3}剪|four pairs of scissors|C|tr=sei3 '''baa2''' gaau3 zin2 }}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 刀囝|a pocketknife|MD|tr=siŏh '''bā''' dŏ̤-giāng}}<ref>{{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects|1677}}</ref>
#: {{zh-x|兩 '''把''' 掃把|two brooms|tr=liǎng '''bǎ''' sǎobǎ}}
# {{zh-classifier|[[handful]]s of something, such as [[grain]]s, [[soil]]}}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 米|a '''handful''' of rice|tr=yī '''bǎ''' mǐ}}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 糖果|a '''handful''' of candy|tr=yī '''bǎ''' tángguǒ}}
# {{zh-classifier|[[bundle]]s or [[bunch]]es}}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 鮮花|a '''bunch''' of flowers|tr=yī '''bǎ''' xiānhuā}}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 韭菜|a '''bunch''' of garlic chives|tr=yī '''bǎ''' jiǔcài }}
# {{zh-classifier|[[fire]]}}
#: {{zh-x|點 一 把 火|to light a '''fire'''}}
# {{zh-classifier|some [[abstract]] [[idea]]s, such as [[force]], [[effort]] or [[age]]}}
#: {{zh-x|加 把 勁兒{r}！|Make an extra effort!|tr=Jiā '''bǎ''' jìnr! }}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 年紀}}
# {{zh-classifier|something done with the [[hand]]}}
#: {{zh-x|幫 你 一 把|to give you a helping hand|tr=bāng nǐ yī '''bǎ'''}}
# {{zh-classifier|[[time]]s of [[recreation]]s}}
#: {{zh-x|過癮\過 把 過癮\癮|to satisfy a craving}}
#: {{zh-x|打 把 麻將|to play mahjong}}
#: {{zh-x|玩 兩 把 牌|to play card games}}
#: {{zh-x|打 幾 把 遊戲|to play video games}}
#: {{zh-x|汏浴\汏 把 汏浴\浴|to bathe|SH|tr=sh:6da+5po+8yoq}}<ref>{{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects|1675}}</ref>
# {{lb|zh|Xiamen Hokkien|&|Quanzhou Hokkien}} {{zh-classifier|[[wheeled]] [[vehicles]]}}
#: {{zh-x|一 把 跤踏車|a bicycle|MN|tr=chi̍t '''pé''' kha-ta̍h-chhia}}<ref>{{RQ:Great Dictionary of Modern Chinese Dialects|1677}}</ref>
# {{n-g-lite|Placed after numerals or classifiers to express uncertainty}}; [[approximately]]
#: {{zh-x|個 把 月|'''approximately''' a month}}
